  "Header":           "MMC-STD-V2.5",

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Speech Translation with Descriptors: translates a Speech Object (or an Input Text Object, when the Text/Speech Selector chooses it) into the language the Language Selector names and gives the translated Speech Object, in the voice of the input speech, and the translated Text Object. Automatic Speech Recognition recognises the speech; Entity Speech Description describes the voice; Text-to-Text Translation translates the text; Text-to-Speech with Descriptors speaks the translation with the voice described. There is no direct speech-to-speech translation.",

